                          |
        +-----------------+------------------+
        |                 |                  |
     Scalar             List              Code
        |                 |
        |                 +------+------+
        |                        |      |
        |                     Array   Hash
        |
        +--------+--------+--------+
        |        |        |        |
      Undef   Boolean    Str      Ref
                          |        |
